    ...                                           ${connection}
    ...                                           ${bts_type}
    Robot Log Operation                           Clearing unstable voltage alarm (Fault ID 4680) by resetting RMOD-${rmod_id}
    Reset RMOD and wait for it to be available    rmod_id=${rmod_id}
